  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the circuit shown in the figure, the ratio of the quality factor and the band width is _____ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0055_fc5b427df272.png\" style=\"width: 321px; height: 180px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "10",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0055_fc5b427df272.png\" style=\"width: 321px; height: 180px;\" /></p><p>For an LCR circuit,</p><p>Bandwidth <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mi>L</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math></p><p>For an LCR&nbsp;circuit quality factor <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mi>L</mi></msqrt><mrow><mi>R</mi><msqrt><mi>C</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msqrt><mn>27</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Therefore, required ratio</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>.</p>"
  }
